# {{ project }}

A Phalcon ADR application.

## Run it

With docker:

    crest up
    crest install

With PHP and composer on the host:

    composer install
    crest serve

Then open http://localhost:8080/.

## Layout

| Path | Contents |
|---|---|
| `public/index.php` | The web entry point |
| `src/AppFront.php` | The front controller: container, providers, application |
| `{{ actionPath }}/` | One class for each route. `GET /` is `{{ actionPath }}/{{ seed }}.php` |
| `crest.php` | The crest configuration |

## Next steps

Use the crest in `vendor/` for these commands. It uses the autoloader and
the Phalcon of this project. On the host:

    vendor/bin/crest make:action GET /hello
    vendor/bin/crest route:list

With docker:

    docker compose exec {{ service }} vendor/bin/crest make:action GET /hello
    docker compose exec {{ service }} vendor/bin/crest route:list
